  "content": "\n\n<h1>ContingameIME</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">IngameIME</a> 的非官方续作。支持在全屏 Minecraft 中使用输入法。</p>\n<h1>切换键</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>单击热键可在<strong>临时输入状态</strong>与<strong>关闭状态</strong>之间切换</li>\n<li>双击热键可切换到<strong>打开模式</strong></li>\n<li>当鼠标移动且已有内容已确认时，<strong>临时输入状态</strong>将自动切换为<strong>关闭状态</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>依赖项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Forge</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin for Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Forge)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>Fabric</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Fabric)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/satin-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satin API</a> <strong>（可选，与 Optifine 冲突）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>本模组运行需要 VCRuntime141，请前往微软官网<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flearn.microsoft.com%252fen-US%252fcpp%252fwindows%252flatest-supported-vc-redist\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载链接</a></h3>\n<h1>本模组代码参考/使用了以下项目</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windmill-City/IngameIME-Minecraft</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Wybxc/IngameIME-Minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wybxc/IngameIME-Minecraft</a> (LGPL-2.1)</li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
